+Cosign Admission Controller (Hardened deployment notes)
+ - Use the cosign validating webhook to refuse unsigned images in production namespaces.
+ - Must run with TLS certs (use cert-manager with KubernetesIssuer).
+ - Configure SERVICE_COSIGN_KMS_ARN to point to your KMS-backed public key URI (e.g., ksm://arn:aws:kms:...).
