+ 1. Provision KMS key (AWS/GCP/HSM) and export public key for cosign verification.
+ 2. Deploy webhook container (see services/cosign/webhook/*).
+ 3. Create TLS secret used by webhook service (cert-manager can automate).
+ 4. Create ValidatingWebhookConfiguration referencing the service and CA bundle.
